      651   DEFINE QUERY BR-sel-fields FOR
      652         sel_t-f SCROLLING.
      653   DEFINE QUERY DIALOG-1 FOR
      654         ubflt.filter SCROLLING.
      655   DEFINE BROWSE BR-fields
